{"toolCallId":"call_3adb92306db74bfebb05e9bd1b89cf09","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"10:// its sources. Those can be recomputed and are what this repairs. The rest are\n41:const BACKFILL = '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/graph/backfill-graph-metadata.ts';\n78:  'GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY',\n79:  'GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT',\n86:// graph-metadata.json itself. The others describe description.json contents and\n91:  'GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY',\n92:  'GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT',\n106:// Mirrors SPEC_FOLDER_RE in backfill-graph-metadata.ts.\n241:const REWRITE_TARGETS = ['description.json', 'graph-metadata.json', ...DOCS];\n259:  'description.json',\n347:  const file = path.join(folder, 'description.json');\n411:  const description = path.join(folder, 'description.json');\n518:  // The backfill writer renames its output over the final path component, so a\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"718640","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
